  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of motion of a projectile is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;are in metre.&nbsp;What is the range (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>) of the projectile?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>12</mtext> <mi>x</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0044198_Ans.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 71px;\" /></strong></u><br /><br />Range is the point where <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />thus <math> <mrow> <mn>0</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>12</mtext> <mi>x</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mi>x</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>x</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>16</mtext> <mo mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mo> </mrow> </math>",
    "image": null
  },
